                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f655b92b-9d63-48f2-bc6f-f77f40e29760",
                        "entry_id": "a5e73d39-1055-3904-a533-f18de2f4d85c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "hikers"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5b056b7e-e492-37cc-a560-a716feabe97a",
                        "entry_id": "a5e73d39-1055-3904-a533-f18de2f4d85c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who hikes, especially frequently."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "de323eea-f913-4772-bbfb-16bb48c603cc",
                                "sense_id": "5b056b7e-e492-37cc-a560-a716feabe97a",
                                "text": "The mother looks over her shoulder, and the hiker could swear she gives the weaning calf a dirty look; the time has come for the young animal to enter moosehood, to stop living in two worlds, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "999b8047-a781-4cc7-bc4c-af210fdba242",
                                "sense_id": "5b056b7e-e492-37cc-a560-a716feabe97a",
                                "text": "On Taipa Island, there are two trails, the 2.2km Taipa Grande and 2.3km Taipa Pequena which take hikers to the two highest points of the island, offering a panoramic view of Macau. The Taipa Grande trail takes about 2? hours and can be reached through a short paved road off the Estrada Colonel Nicolau de Mesquita, near the United Chinese Cemetery. Adjacent to the trail on the east side of Taipa Grande, near the airport, is the Taipa Grande Nature Park. The Taipa Pequena trail can be accessed from the Estrada Lou Lim Ieoc, behind the Regency Hotel, and takes about two hours."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "66ce6d26-2e78-40dd-90cf-2405ae91e220",
                                "sense_id": "5b056b7e-e492-37cc-a560-a716feabe97a",
                                "text": "Members of the Taitung County Fire Department’s Kuanshan Branch rescue an injured hiker in Taitung on Thursday."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5b122a2c-adf9-409c-810d-1885741ab5b7",
                        "source_entry_id": "a5e73d39-1055-3904-a533-f18de2f4d85c",
                        "source_sense_id": "5b056b7e-e492-37cc-a560-a716feabe97a",
                        "source_sense_description": "one who hikes, especially frequently",
                        "target_lang_word": "randonneur",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "randonneur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "afbf6fa2-7f68-39eb-89e1-1b8260932468",
                                        "entry_id": "2f77dac9-b291-34e1-9f57-4912175b5ff7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marcheur qui pratique la randonnée, qui fait une randonnée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a7a9b98-82c9-4002-8d2d-c35365636b1b",
                                                "sense_id": "afbf6fa2-7f68-39eb-89e1-1b8260932468",
                                                "text": "L'été, les troupeaux de vaches d’Abondance regardent tranquillement passer les randonneurs et les vététistes dans les alpages et les sentiers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8f82b43-246d-4aab-bf34-5445244f5710",
                                                "sense_id": "afbf6fa2-7f68-39eb-89e1-1b8260932468",
                                                "text": "Après avoir parcouru avec mes amis randonneurs le trajet d’Hendaye au cirque de Gavarnie, ensemble nous attaquons en cette année 1987 le tronçon des Pyrénées centrales qui doit nous mener vers Bagnères-de-Luchon par la HRP, le massif de la Maladeta et le pic d’Aneto, point culminant des Pyrénées."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa65bcbf-e9c4-4e65-96b7-7c21124804a5",
                                                "sense_id": "afbf6fa2-7f68-39eb-89e1-1b8260932468",
                                                "text": "Sernot était un varappeur, un randonneur, un de ces types amateurs de longues marches exténuantes, et un insomniaque."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fb27476c-58d5-4cb4-afca-84b33a6b1878",
                        "source_entry_id": "a5e73d39-1055-3904-a533-f18de2f4d85c",
                        "source_sense_id": "5b056b7e-e492-37cc-a560-a716feabe97a",
                        "source_sense_description": "one who hikes, especially frequently",
                        "target_lang_word": "randonneuse",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "randonneuse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27b103a0-3ed5-3bf0-bec0-c4b68df722c2",
